redfin 1206: SweetMesa kern.sweet_mesa_catacomb: Touch ID templates persist through biometrickitd's catacomb (60 state, 61-64 store/load the FPC TA db via sweetfpcd)

Default 0 = 1200 behaviour. 1: 60 answers {user (gUser or 501), present | loaded | dirty}; 61 makes sweetfpcd store the
TA template db and stage a "SWCT" blob, 62 pulls it in 4032-byte chunks, 63 clears dirty, 64 pushes the file's blob in
chunks and loads it. A failed load never returns the codes libBKDM1 maps to 0x10d (file deleted).

